        "original_id": "e0323b61-5a21-527d-9233-b4ec6434aa75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Radomski, Bruce Timm, Isaac C. Singleton Jr.\n- TV series: Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Films: The Avengers, Batman: Mask of the Phantasm\n- Video games: Lego Marvel's Avengers\n- Topics: Disney XD, superhero animation, Thanos\n\nFacts:\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm was directed by Eric Radomski and Bruce Timm and is a cinematic continuation of Batman: The Animated Series.\n- Avengers Assemble was designed to capitalize on the success of the 2012 film The Avengers.\n- Avengers Assemble premiered on Disney XD on May 26, 2013, as the successor to Ultimate Spider-Man.\n- Eric Radomski is associated with the animated series Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., and Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- Isaac C. Singleton Jr. voiced Thanos in the television series Guardians of the Galaxy and Avengers Assemble and in the video game Lego Marvel's Avengers.",
